  "id": "dijon-chicken-salad",
  "name": "Dijon Chicken Salad",
  "subtitle": "A crisp, lightly sweet chicken salad with grapes and cranberries",
  "description": "Combine tender chicken, fresh celery, colorful grapes, and dried cranberries with a honey-Dijon mayonnaise dressing for a quick chilled salad.",
